module Parse

// the Ember parser, in Ember: a port of ember/parse.c.  parse() reads
// a file through the self-hosted lexer and returns the module's tree
// (nil if it could not be opened); parse.c's -A dump and astdump.dis
// print such trees identically (ember/tests/astcmp.sh).

